        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Vanderbilt University, Bowdoin College, Commonwealth of Massachusetts\n- People: Cornelius Vanderbilt\n- Places: the South, Brunswick, Maine\n\nFacts:\n- In 1794, Bowdoin College was chartered when Maine was still part of the Commonwealth of Massachusetts.\n- In 1873, Vanderbilt University was founded.\n- Vanderbilt University was named in honor of Cornelius Vanderbilt.\n- Cornelius Vanderbilt provided Vanderbilt University with its initial $1 million endowment despite never having been to the South.\n- Bowdoin College is a private liberal arts college located in Brunswick, Maine.",
